1053 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Brought on to lead the end\055to\055end product design and AI features for an oncology healthcare platform\054 managing product strategy\054 patient research\054 and cross\055functional work with clinical leaders\056\n\nOwned the full end\055to\055end design process for native iOS and Android apps\024creating user flows\054 wireframes\054 high\055fidelity UI\054 and interactive prototypes\073 designs drove 792 first\055time downloads in the first 6 months live\056\nLed design and product rollout for HopeAI\054 an in\055app conversational AI guide\056 Grew weekly active users \1765x and reached 1\054408 distinct patients in 5 months\054 with roughly half of conversations continuing past a single exchange\056\nPartnered with clinicians\054 healthcare providers\054 and pharma stakeholders to translate complex\054 safety\055critical requirements into experiences that were clear\054 accurate\054 and high\055trust\056\nReduced feature\055set complexity to remove noise from the core experience\054 sustaining an onboarding conversion rate of 88\045\02396\045\056\nBuilt automated AI content workflows using custom Claude agents to structure dense clinical documentation into clear\054 scannable UI components\054 accelerating production while maintaining medical compliance\056\nDefined and shipped an updated brand identity\054 extending it from digital interfaces into print and physical patient materials for a cohesive online\055to\055offline experience in clinical communities\056)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 1054 0 R
     /Pg 1023 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
